{"ref":"BDB, מִיכָיָ֫הוּ","hw":"מִיכָיָ֫הוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָיָ֫הוּ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr. (</strong><em>Who is like Yah?</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מִיכָאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_מִיכָאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">מִיכָאֵל</a><strong>)</strong>:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong>m.</strong> a prince under Jehosh. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.7\">2 Ch 17:7</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.2\">2 Ch 13:2</a> f. l. for <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲכָה</span> <strong>2 b</strong>, q.v. Of this name, the following are abbreviated, or softened, forms—","next":"BDB, מִיכָֽיְהוּ","prev":"BDB, מִיכָאֵל"}